@node Top
@top Code Review User Manual

Code Review lets you review pull requests on Github and merge requests on
Gitlab without leaving Emacs: read the diff and the discussion, write
comments and replies, and approve or request changes.  Its buffers are
built with Magit's sections and its commands are gathered in a Transient
menu.

